      players: '3 to 6 players. Usually played as individuals.',
      deck: "Standard 52ndcard deck. The Ace of Hearts is a special 'Perma-Trump'.",
      equipment: "Standard 52ndcard deck. The Ace of Hearts is a special 'Perma-Trump'.",
      dealing: 'Each player is dealt 5 cards in batches of 3 and 2 (or 2 and 3).',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. Lead: The highest bidder leads the first card.\n2. Trumping: You are NEVER forced to play a trump unless a HIGHER trump is led. You may play a trump even if you can follow suit.\n3. Robbing: If the turnndup card (the trump marker) is an Ace, the dealer can 'rob' it by swapping a low card for it.",
